# Corpse Explosion compatibility scenario (0.113.1), lethal variant
# Applies Corpse Explosion with 2 stacks to enemy 1, kills enemy 0, and asserts
# that the 2 x Max HP damage kills the remaining slugs and ends combat.

fight CORPSE_SLUGS_NORMAL
wait combat-started
ce_probe
power CORPSE_EXPLOSION_POWER 2 1
kill 0
wait 3
ce_probe
ce_check combat-ended
